    "section": "3.35",
    "heading": "As a Multiclass Character",
    "lineStart": 2435,
    "lineEnd": 2438
  },
  "section": "3.35",
  "rulesText": "- Gain the following traits from the Core Bard Traits table: Hit Point Die, proficiency in one skill of your choice, proficiency with one Musical Instrument of your choice, and training with Light armor.  \n- Gain the Bard's level 1 features, which are listed in the Bard Features table. See the multiclassing rules in “Character Creation” to determine your available spell slots."
}
